l server.\n`WeatherClient.get` in `weather.py` now retries on HTTP 503, up to 3 attempts in total.\n\n- **Backoff:** it sleeps `backoff * 2**(n-1)` seconds between attempts, so 0.5s then 1s by default.\n- **Settings:** I added two constructor arguments, `attempts=3` and `backoff=0.5`, so they can be changed.\n- **Other errors:** any other HTTP error, or a 503 on the final attempt, is raised as before.\n\nI checked it against a local test server:\n\n| Server behavior | Result | Requests made |\n|---|---|---|\n| Healthy | Success | 1 |\n| 503 twice, then OK | Success | 3 |\n| 503 every time | `HTTPError` 503 raised | 3 |\n\nI only ran that throwaway script and didn't add a test file to the repo.\n\nConnection errors and timeouts are not retried. `urlopen` raises those as `URLError`, and you asked for 503 only.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "params_stripped": [], "params_stripped_requests": 0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 1, "replies_ok": 5, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 105902, "requests_cache_write": 72040, "requests_cost_usd": 0.2058642, "requests_count": 5, "requests_input_uncached": 12, "requests_output": 1515, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-netclient:claude-opus-5-5:trial16", "run_seed": 1016, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 90, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-18T00:45:43.298560+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 15.322, "t_checker_s": 2.381, "t_env_setup_s": 0.0, "task": "trig-omp-netclient", "task_calls": 0, "thinking_mode": "off", "thinking_sent": ["none", "none", "none", "none", "none"], "timeout_s": 840, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 1527, "tokens_cache_read": 105902, "tokens_cache_write": 72040, "tokens_fresh": 1527, "tokens_input_uncached": 12, "tokens_main_cache_read": 105902, "tokens_main_cach